{"id":"en_mom-from-the-graveyard","title":"Mom From the Graveyard","titleEn":"Mom From the Graveyard","description":"When Gina’s two children arrive to bury their mother, something else rises from the graveyard in her place: a Bone Demon wearing Gina’s form. Assuming the dead woman’s identity, the demon sets about raising the children while pursuing vengeance on Gina’s behalf. Her actions begin to alter the destinies of women throughout the village, and before long the locals revere her as the Bone Goddess. The central question is whether she can continue to act as the children’s mother without her true nature coming to light.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/mom-from-the-graveyard/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/mom-from-the-graveyard/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Fantasy Romance","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtblu/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_mom-from-the-graveyard_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtblu/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_mom-from-the-graveyard_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtblu/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_mom-from-the-graveyard_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtblu/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_mom-from-the-graveyard_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtblu/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}